@startuml identity-model
'==============================================================================
' Figure (Chapter II): Identity and access model (conceptual class diagram).
' From the comby defaults: tenant, account, identity (an account can hold
' identities in several tenants), group (RBAC role), permission.
' Render:  plantuml -tpdf identity-model.puml      (or -tpng)
'==============================================================================
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 20
left to right direction
hide circle
hide methods
hide empty members

class Account
class Identity
class Tenant
class Group
class Permission

Account  "1" --> "1..*" Identity : has
Tenant   "1" --> "0..*" Identity : scopes
Identity "*" --> "*"    Group    : member of
Group    "1" --> "1..*" Permission : grants

note top of Tenant
  One customer organisation per tenant.
  A reserved system tenant holds the
  platform's system administrators.
end note
@enduml
